The Rust engine gained new FFI methods (rewind_session, fork_session,
respond_to_approval_with_args, follow_up_with_attachments, get_engine_features,
remove_mcp_tools). The committed xcframework predates them and cannot be rebuilt
on Linux. The "iOS agent xcframework" workflow rebuilds it on macOS on the next
push to main that touches plugins/native-agent/rust/** and deletes this file.
Until then an iOS build links against the old binary and fails on the new symbols.
